The datasets in this folder are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

They are derived from the Financial PhraseBank (Sentences_AllAgree subset),
which is licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0:

  Malo, P., Sinha, A., Korhonen, P., Wallenius, J., & Takala, P. (2014).
  Good debt or bad debt: Detecting semantic orientations in economic texts.
  Journal of the Association for Information Science and Technology, 65(4), 782-796.

Files:
  base_sentences.csv                          150 sentences selected from Financial PhraseBank
  triggerbank.csv                             Final dataset: bias-injected and unbiased sentences
  prompt_sensitivity/sample_30.csv            Stratified sample of 30 base sentences
  prompt_sensitivity/biased_sample_alt_1.csv  Sample injected with alternative prompt 1
  prompt_sensitivity/biased_sample_alt_2.csv  Sample injected with alternative prompt 2

The code in this repository is licensed separately under the MIT License (see ../LICENSE).
